  "summary": "Knowledge and completion receipts hold durable outcomes. Main obtains independent Review and binds attributed four-field verification reports. Concord does not execute repository tests, retain native receipts or inspect live Git for workflow freshness. Recorded commits must agree; required CI, approvals and verified-snapshot retirement remain.",
